  "title": "The boundary of a living system is a Markov blanket",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "b9017dac-311a-4221-b7bc-e9d1a5486fc8",
      "text": "The boundary that sets a living system apart is a Markov blanket: the states that make its internal states conditionally independent of its external states. It need not coincide with a membrane or skin.",
